">1</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">PTX<sup>c</sup></td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">10</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">1</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">4</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">5</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">NK105<sup>d</sup></td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">14</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">8</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">2</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">4</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="tbfnote7"><label/><p>PTX=paclitaxel.</p></fn><fn id="tbfnote8"><label/><p>Vehicle, NK105 or PTX was administered i.v. at a weekly dose of 7.5&#x02009;mg&#x02009;kg<sup>&#x02212;1</sup> for 6 consecutive weeks to female rats.</p></fn><fn id="tbfnote9"><label>a</label><p>Total number of animals accounted for that experimental condition.</p></fn><fn id="tbfnote10"><label>b</label><p>Degenerating myelinated fibre score was defined as follows: &#x02212;, no degenerative changes; &#x0002b;/&#x02212;, very slight degree of the degenerative changes (scattered, single fibres affected); &#x0002b;, slight degree of degenerative changes (scattered small groups of degenerative myelinated fibers); &#x0002b;&#x0002b;, moderate degree of degenerative changes (disseminated degenerative myelinated fibers); &#x0002b;&#x0002b;&#x0002b;, marked degree of degenerative changes (confluent groups of affected fibres).</p></fn><fn id="tbfnote11"><label>c</label><p><italic>P</italic>&#x0003c;0.001 <italic>vs</italic> vehicle-treated animals.</p></fn><fn id="tbfnote12"><label>d</label><p><italic>P</italic>&#x0003c;0.001 <italic>vs</italic> PTX-treated animals.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>